   "title": "Method 1: 180° − 60°",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\cos120^\\circ=\\cos(180^\\circ-60^\\circ)\\\\[5pt]&{}=\\cos180^\\circ\\cos60^\\circ+\\sin180^\\circ\\sin60^\\circ\\\\[5pt]&{}=(-1)\\Big(\\dfrac12\\Big)+0=\\textcolor{#047857}{\\mathbf{-\\dfrac12}}\\end{aligned}\\]",
