   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\cos120^\\circ=\\cos(90^\\circ+30^\\circ)\\\\[5pt]&{}=\\cos90^\\circ\\cos30^\\circ-\\sin90^\\circ\\sin30^\\circ\\\\[5pt]&{}=0-(1)\\Big(\\dfrac12\\Big)=\\textcolor{#047857}{\\mathbf{-\\dfrac12}}\\end{aligned}\\]",
